{"id": "DemMV03uWzP", "title": "Video by index.opensource", "description": "What happens when you mix a growing coral with terrain erosion?\n\ndlaf lets wandering particles stick together into branches. We turn its 2D branches into a ridge height map and feed it to Terrain Erosion. After 716 rounds of simulated rain, valleys cut through the landscape.\n\nThen we take a 3D coral of 6,000 particles, turn its parent links into rounded shapes, and use sdf to create an STL mesh. ln slices that mesh at 131 heights and removes hidden lines to draw it on screen.\n\nThese are digital outputs: a simulated landscape, an STL file and a line drawing.\n\n\uc790\ub77c\ub098\ub294 \uc0b0\ud638\uc5d0 \uc9c0\ud615 \uce68\uc2dd\uc744 \uc11e\uc73c\uba74 \uc5b4\ub5bb\uac8c \ub420\uae4c\uc694?\n\ndlaf\ub294 \ubb34\uc791\uc704\ub85c \uc6c0\uc9c1\uc774\ub294 \uc785\uc790\ub4e4\uc744 \ubd99\uc5ec \uac00\uc9c0\ub97c \ud0a4\uc6cc\uc694. 2D \uac00\uc9c0\ub97c \uc0b0\ub4f1\uc131\uc774 \ub192\uc774 \uc9c0\ub3c4\ub85c \ubc14\uafd4 Terrain Erosion\uc5d0 \ub123\uc5c8\uc5b4\uc694. \ube44\ub97c 716\ubc88 \uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158\ud558\uc790 \uc9c0\ud615\uc5d0 \uace8\uc9dc\uae30\uac00 \ud30c\uc5ec\uc694.\n\n\uc774\uc5b4\uc11c \uc785\uc790 6\ucc9c \uac1c\ub85c \uc790\ub780 3D \uc0b0\ud638\uc758 \ubd80\ubaa8 \uc5f0\uacb0\uc744 \ub465\uadfc \ud615\ud0dc\ub85c \ubc14\uafb8\uace0, sdf\ub85c STL \uba54\uc2dc\ub97c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc5b4\uc694. ln\uc740 \uadf8 \uba54\uc2dc\ub97c \ub192\uc774 131\uacf3\uc5d0\uc11c \uc790\ub978 \ub4a4 \uac00\ub824\uc9c4 \uc120\uc744 \uc5c6\uc560 \ud654\uba74\uc5d0 \uadf8\ub824\uc694.\n\n\uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158 \uc9c0\ud615, STL \ud30c\uc77c, \uc120 \uadf8\ub9bc\uae4c\uc9c0 \ubaa8\ub450 \ub514\uc9c0\ud138 \uacb0\uacfc\ubb3c\uc774\uc5d0\uc694.\n\nCredits / \ucd9c\ucc98\nTerrain Erosion: Daniel Andrino \u00b7 MIT\nhttps://github.com/dandrino/terrain-erosion-3-ways\ndlaf \u00b7 sdf \u00b7 ln: Michael Fogleman \u00b7 MIT\nhttps://github.com/fogleman/dlaf\nhttps://github.com/fogleman/sdf\nhttps://github.com/fogleman/ln\nRendering: three.js \u00b7 MIT\nInput conversion, connecting code and visuals: our production\n\uc785\ub825 \ubcc0\ud658\u00b7\uc5f0\uacb0 \ucf54\ub4dc\u00b7\ud654\uba74 \uad6c\uc131: \uc790\uccb4 \uc81c\uc791\nCurated by @hyun2xyz\n\n#OpenSource #CreativeCoding #GenerativeArt", "channel": "index.opensource", "uploader_id": "60040254965", "uploader": "index.opensource", "timestamp": 1792242990, "like_count": 378, "comment_count": 5, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1794570691826234a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 51.842, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNmaIEsEnkeuVO3Aen4GDrnzV2apnnVxjVEjhFmEn5tQl01fJMXbTP3esTh0H-gq0WUHQhqDxSSE5H78jdGP3uJxCm1isCTHJgaEDo.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=3CsSlQdL6AcQ7kNvwFTRhle&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=nJT9nJI5Xxuob4k7j07saw&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQMaF2P_U8WtcFlnQUOUZWmeSgF2Wco73FrfyePgNpk7nQ&oe=6AE218E5", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 51.842, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": null, "filesize_approx": null, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "e